</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="privacy-controls">Privacy Controls</h2>
<p>Email is sensitive. mtk provides explicit privacy controls:</p>
<h3 id="exclusion-rules">Exclusion Rules</h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c"># ~/.config/mtk/privacy.yaml</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="nt">exclude</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="c"># Exclude by address</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="nt">addresses</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span>- <span class="s2">&#34;*@work.com&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span>- <span class="s2">&#34;boss@company.com&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="c"># Exclude by tag</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="nt">tags</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span>- <span class="s2">&#34;work&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span>- <span class="s2">&#34;confidential&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="c"># Exclude by content pattern</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="nt">patterns</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span>- <span class="s2">&#34;CONFIDENTIAL&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span>- <span class="s2">&#34;attorney-client&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="redaction-rules">Redaction Rules</h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nt">redact</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="c"># Redact specific patterns in exported content</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="nt">patterns</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span>- <span class="nt">pattern</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s1">&#39;\b\d{3}-\d{2}-\d{4}\b&#39;</span><span class="w">  </span><span class="c"># SSN</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span><span class="nt">replacement</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">&#34;[REDACTED-SSN]&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span>- <span class="nt">pattern</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s1">&#39;secret-project-\w+&#39;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span><span class="nt">replacement</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">&#34;[REDACTED-PROJECT]&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="export-levels">Export Levels</h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">mtk <span class="nb">export</span> --level personal   <span class="c1"># Only personal (non-work)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">mtk <span class="nb">export</span> --level family     <span class="c1"># Only family</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">mtk <span class="nb">export</span> --level all        <span class="c1"># Everything (careful!)</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="import-sources-planned">Import Sources (Planned)</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th>Source</th>
          <th>Format</th>
          <th>Priority</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td>Maildir</td>
          <td>standard</td>
          <td>HIGH</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>mbox</td>
          <td>standard</td>
          <td>HIGH</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>Gmail Takeout</td>
          <td>MBOX in zip</td>
          <td>HIGH</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>EML files</td>
          <td>individual emails</td>
          <td>MEDIUM</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>IMAP</td>
          <td>direct download</td>
          <td>MEDIUM</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>Outlook PST</td>
          <td>proprietary</td>
          <td>LOW</td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<h2 id="integration-with-notmuch">Integration with notmuch</h2>
<p>mtk does not replace notmuch — it enhances it:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│                         YOUR MAIL                                │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│                    (Maildir structure)                           │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">└────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">                             │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">              ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">              ▼                              ▼
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">┌─────────────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────────────┐
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│        NOTMUCH          │    │          MTK            │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│                         │    │                         │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│  • Xapian index         │◄───│  • Shadow SQLite        │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│  • Full-text search     │    │  • Embeddings           │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│  • Tags                 │    │  • Relationships        │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│  • Threads              │    │  • Privacy rules        │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│                         │    │  • Summaries            │
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">└─────────────────────────┘    └─────────────────────────┘
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="technical-notes">Technical Notes</h2>
<h3 id="notmuch-dependency">notmuch Dependency</h3>
<p>mtk requires notmuch to be installed:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># Debian/Ubuntu</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt install notmuch
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># Arch</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo pacman -S notmuch
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># macOS</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">brew install notmuch
</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="shadow-database">Shadow Database</h3>
<p>mtk maintains a SQLite database alongside notmuch&rsquo;s Xapian index:</p>
<ul>
<li>Embeddings (notmuch doesn&rsquo;t have these)</li>
<li>Relationship data</li>
<li>Summaries</li>
<li>Privacy rules</li>
<li>Export metadata</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="embedding-generation">Embedding Generation</h3>
<p>For semantic search, mtk generates embeddings for email content:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># Using sentence-transformers</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">from</span> <span class="nn">sentence_transformers</span> <span class="kn">import</span> <span class="n">SentenceTransformer</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">model</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">SentenceTransformer</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s1">&#39;all-MiniLM-L6-v2&#39;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">embedding</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">model</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">encode</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">email</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">body_text</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="development">Development</h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">cd</span> ~/github/beta/mtk
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">python -m venv .venv
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">source</span> .venv/bin/activate
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install -e .
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="dependencies-planned">Dependencies (Planned)</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>notmuch</strong> — Core mail indexing (required)</li>
<li><strong>notmuch Python bindings</strong> — <code>notmuch2</code> package</li>
<li><strong>sentence-transformers</strong> — Embeddings</li>
<li><strong>faiss</strong> — Vector search</li>
<li><strong>ollama</strong> (optional) — Summarization</li>
</ul>
